The HTML Standard's named character references
(https://html.spec.whatwg.org/entities.json, fetched 2026-11-27), unchanged.
The HTML Standard is by WHATWG (Apple, Google, Mozilla, Microsoft), under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Ariadne's tokenizer (ariadne/) turns it into an OCaml table when it is
built (ariadne/gen-entities.sh).
